---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy | LearnNest" description="LearnNest privacy policy for the demo site: no accounts, no payments, no tracking, and demo forms that send nothing." path="/privacy-policy">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: 22 November 2026. This policy is for the LearnNest demo site.</p>
  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>LearnNest is a demonstration website. There are no user accounts, no logins, no payments and no live lessons. The tutors shown are sample profiles, not real people.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>We collect nothing.</strong> The booking, tutor-application, business-enquiry and contact forms on this site are demonstrations. When you submit one, your entry is shown back to you on the same page only — it is not sent to a server, not saved, and not emailed to anyone.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>This site uses no tracking cookies and no analytics that identify you. See the <a href="/cookies-policy">cookies policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>If LearnNest becomes a real service</h2>
  <p>If accounts, payments and real tutor profiles are added later, this policy will be replaced with a full policy explaining what is collected, why, how long it is kept, and how to ask for it to be deleted — before any personal data is collected.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>There is no published email address for this demo. Use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>, which sends nothing.</p>
</BaseLayout>
